            0.548,
            0.677,
            0.589
          ],
          "content": "？ How do we find the area of this quadrilateral? What measurements do we need for this?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.591,
            0.677,
            0.65
          ],
          "content": "If we join BD, the quadrilateral ABCD gets divided into two triangles. By finding their areas, we can find the area of ABCD."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.68,
            0.557,
