        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.82,
            0.571,
            0.844
          ],
          "content": "？ Can any polygon be divided into triangles?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.845,
            0.849,
            0.904
          ],
          "content": "It can be seen that any polygon can be divided into triangles. Thus, by knowing how to compute the area of a triangle, we can find the area of any polygon."
